1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:06,530
Do you realize this is the last time we'll be here...
你們知道這是最後一次 我們以六個單身朋友的身份…

2
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,290
as six single people?
共聚一堂嗎？

3
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:11,470
What's happening to the coffeehouse?
咖啡廳怎麼了？

4
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:18,710
From now on, it's you four and me and the missus.
從現在開始，是你們四個好朋友 我跟我太太了

5
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:22,440
The little woman. The wife. The old ball and chain.
我的小女人，好老婆 老的繫絆

6
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,950
-Old? -The young, hot ball and chain.
-老的？ -你是年輕性感的繫絆

7
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,710
-Much better. -We gotta go.
-好多了 -我們得走了

8
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,450
-Where? -Get the dress and lunch with mom.
-去哪裡？ -我要去拿婚紗，跟媽媽一起吃午餐

9
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,930
Joey, you too?
喬伊，你也要去？

10
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:37,330
I just heard "lunch."
我聽到了「午餐」

11
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,820
Yeah, I can go. Sure.
對，我可以去，當然

12
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:46,440
Actually, I'm glad they're leaving.
事實上我很高興他們離開了

13
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:49,230
I need to talk to you about something.
有件事我得跟你談一談

14
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:52,580
-What's up? -This may be a little awkward.
-什麼事？ -這或許會有點嚇人

15
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:57,620
If you need money, it's a bad time. I'm buying 128 dinners tomorrow.
如果你需要錢，時機真的不太對 明天晚上我得請一百二十八個人吃晚餐

16
00:00:58,290 --> 00:01:00,080
No, it's not that.
不，不是那樣的

17
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:04,420
I'm not gonna say this as your friend...
我不是以你朋友的身份 跟你說話…

18
00:01:04,630 --> 00:01:07,030
but as Monica's older brother.
我要以摩妮卡大哥的身份跟你談

19
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:10,720
-But you're still my friend? -Not for a few minutes.
-但你還是我朋友吧？ -接下來的幾分鐘不是

20
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:15,100
-Right now, are you still my best man? -No.
-現在你還是我的伴郎嗎？ -不是

21
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:19,030
Do I still call you Ross?
我還是可以叫你羅斯嗎？

22
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:26,380
You guys are getting married, and I couldn't be more thrilled.
你們要結婚了，我真的很高興

23
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:30,350
But as her older brother, I have to tell you this:
但身為她的大哥 我得告訴你一件事

24
00:01:32,390 --> 00:01:35,750
If you ever hurt my little sister...
如果你敢傷害我妹妹…

25
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:41,630
if you ever cause her any unhappiness of any kind...
如果你敢讓她不快樂…

26
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,060
I will hunt you down...
天涯海角我都會找到你…

27
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,990
and kick your ass.
我會痛扁你

28
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:56,370
What? I'm serious.
什麼？我是認真的

29
00:01:58,350 --> 00:02:03,370
-Dude! Stop it! I'm not kidding. -I hear what you're saying...
-兄弟，別鬧了，我不是在開玩笑 -我聽到你的話了…

30
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:06,310
and thanks for the warning.
謝謝你的警告

31
00:02:06,550 --> 00:02:07,850
No problem.
別客氣

32
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:11,080
Are we friends again?
我們又是朋友了？

33
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,660
Yeah.
對

34
00:02:13,390 --> 00:02:17,230
You won't believe what Monica's brother just said to me!
你不會相信剛剛摩妮卡的 哥哥跟我說了什麼！

35
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:20,660
The One With Monica and Chandler's Wedding
摩妮卡和錢德的婚禮上集

00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:22,660
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

36
00:02:57,210 --> 00:02:58,670
What you doing, Mon?
你在做什麼？摩妮卡

37
00:02:58,910 --> 00:03:02,900
I'm listing things that could go wrong at the wedding.
我在列出 婚禮上可能會出差錯的事情

38
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:06,370
So I can be prepared.
那樣子我可以做好準備

39
00:03:06,610 --> 00:03:11,020
-What are they? -"The dresses won't get picked up...
-哪些事會出差錯？ -到目前為止有婚紗忘了拿…

40
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:14,690
veil gets lost, and I'm missing something blue."
我的頭紗不見了 或是我忘了拿藍色的東西

41
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:16,980
I'm responsible for all those.
那是我負責的事

42
00:03:18,430 --> 00:03:20,360
I had to go with the odds.
我得做好萬全準備

44
00:03:23,130 --> 00:03:25,600
Remember I didn't get that part?
你們還記得之前我去試鏡 沒有拿到那個角色的事嗎？

45
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:27,800
-The commercial? -That play?
-那個廣告？ -那出舞台劇？

46
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,500
That other play?
另一出舞台劇？

47
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,770
-The movie? -Yes!
-那部電影？ -對

48
00:03:32,010 --> 00:03:34,410
The one about the dog who flies planes?
那部狗會開飛機的電影？

49
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:37,610
No. But man, that one hurt.
不，但我真的很傷心

50
00:03:37,810 --> 00:03:42,010
-This is the one about WWI soldiers. -Oh, yeah.
-這部電影在描述一次大戰的士兵 -喔，對

51
00:03:42,250 --> 00:03:45,010
Back then we called it "The Great War."
以前我們叫它「大戰」

52
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:48,250
It really was.
它真的是大戰

53
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:53,390
A guy they wanted backed out! I start shooting today!
他們錄取的那個角色不演了！ 我今天就要開始拍戲！

54
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:54,750
Congratulations!
恭喜！

55
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:58,430
-Today's the dinner. -I'll be done by then.
-今天有綵排晚宴 -我一定會趕過去的

56
00:03:58,670 --> 00:04:01,400
Oh. Then way to go, you big movie star!
喔，那麼太棒了 你成了電影明星！

57
00:04:01,670 --> 00:04:04,330
See you. I'm off to fight the Nazis.
待會見，我要去跟納粹作戰了

58
00:04:04,610 --> 00:04:08,940
Wait, Joey. We fought the Nazis in WWII, not WWI.
等一下，喬伊，納粹是我們 在二次大戰的敵人，不是一次大戰

59
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:11,170
Whoa.

60
00:04:11,550 --> 00:04:13,310
Who was in WWI?
誰是我們在一次大戰的敵人？

61
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,850
Go ahead.
你說吧

62
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,980
You're gonna be late! Go! Go!
你要遲到了！快去…

63
00:04:23,260 --> 00:04:25,780
Who did we fight in WWI?
誰是我們在一次大戰的敵人？

64
00:04:26,090 --> 00:04:28,590
-Mexico? -Yes. Very good.
-墨西哥？ -對，非常棒

65
00:04:31,337 --> 00:04:33,134
（五十九號碼頭片廠）

66
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:47,350
-Hey, Joey. We're ready. -Yeah, me too.
-嘿，喬伊，我們準備好了 -我也是

67
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:49,640
Richard, we're ready for you.
理查，我們準備好了

68
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:53,510
Joey Tribbiani, Richard Crosby is playing Vincent.
喬伊崔比亞尼，這位是理查克洛斯比 他要飾演文森

69
00:04:54,790 --> 00:04:57,590
-I'm acting with you? -Nice to meet you.
-我要跟你演對手戲？ -很高興能認識你

70
00:04:57,830 --> 00:05:01,960
I can't believe this. Incredible. You just won an Oscar.
我不敢相信，這太不可思議了 你剛剛拿下奧斯卡金像獎

71
00:05:02,660 --> 00:05:04,360
No, I didn't.
不，我沒有

72
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:06,660
I think you did.
我知道你有

73
00:05:07,900 --> 00:05:10,870
I think I lost, three times.
我想三次我都輸了

74
00:05:12,470 --> 00:05:14,810
-Cookie? Would you...? -No.
-餅乾？你要…？ -不

75
00:05:15,510 --> 00:05:19,500
We're about an hour away from getting the scene lit.
再過一小時我們就要正式開拍

76
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:23,980
-Can you guys run it a couple times? -Yeah, sure.
-你們能對一下戲嗎？ -沒問題

77
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:26,050
All right. Let's do it.
好了，我們開始吧

78
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:29,810
And... action!
好了…開始！

79
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:34,150
-We have to find the platoon! -Forget it, the platoon is gone!
-我們得找到其他士兵！ -算了吧，他們已經不在了！

80
00:05:37,370 --> 00:05:41,500
-What? -Platoon's dead! Face facts, Tony!
-什麼？ -他們都死了！面對現實吧，東尼！

81
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:46,340
What'll we do? We have no reinforcements or food.
我們該怎麼辦？ 我們沒有援兵或食物

82
00:05:46,570 --> 00:05:50,340
There's food in the basement. Potatoes and some pasta.
地下室有食物 有馬鈴薯跟一些意大利面

83
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:54,880
Hang on. Joey, you keep touching your face.
等一下，喬伊，你一直在摸你的臉

84
00:05:55,150 --> 00:05:56,210
Something wrong?
有什麼問題嗎？

85
00:05:57,190 --> 00:05:58,880
No.
不，沒有

86
00:06:00,690 --> 00:06:03,680
I thought it might be a cool character thing.
我以為這麼做會很酷

87
00:06:03,930 --> 00:06:06,720
He's a face toucher.
他是個喜歡摸臉的人

88
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:11,860
I don't think so.
我可不那麼認為

89
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:17,300
Let's take it back to Richard's last lines. Action!
我們從理查 最後一句台詞開始，開始！

90
00:06:18,110 --> 00:06:20,700
No weapons, but we still have food.
雖然我們沒有武器 但我們還有食物

91
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:22,710
Potatoes, pasta...
馬鈴薯，意大利面…

92
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,880
and a few tins of tuna!
跟幾罐鮪魚

93
00:06:27,580 --> 00:06:29,710
Honey, we gotta go!
甜心，我們得走了！

94
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:32,710
Here's a question you never want to ask:
這個問題真的很難啟齒

95
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:36,820
Can my dad borrow one of your pearl necklaces?
我爸能借用你的珍珠項鏈嗎？

96
00:06:37,790 --> 00:06:40,760
Did he say what kind of neckline he's wearing?
他有提到 他的領口剪裁是哪一種的嗎？

97
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,120
No.
沒有

98
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:45,100
I just met him once, but I'm guessing...
我只見過他一次但我猜…

99
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:46,390
plunging?
是低胸的？

100
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:51,270
He is more of a if-you've-got-it- flaunt-it kind of father.
他是那種不嚇死人不罷休的爸爸

101
00:06:52,410 --> 00:06:54,600
Let me see if Rachel has anything.
我去問問瑞秋有沒有適合的項鏈

102
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:56,970
Yes, include more people.
對，把更多的人扯進來

103
00:06:58,950 --> 00:07:02,940
Do you realize that tomorrow we're gonna be getting married?
你知道明天這個時候 我們要結婚嗎？

104
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:05,210
I have a date tomorrow night.
我明天晚上有約了

105
00:07:06,590 --> 00:07:10,720
-I can't believe we made it. -Don't sound so surprised.
-我不敢相信我們真的辦到了 -別一副很訝異的樣子

106
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,430
I'm sorry, but...
對不起，但是…

107
00:07:13,290 --> 00:07:15,790
-Nothing. -What?
-沒事 -什麼？

108
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:20,360
Well, honestly? Ever since we got engaged...
喔，真的嗎？自從我們訂婚後…

109
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:23,430
I've waited for you to flip out.
我一直在期待 發生什麼事讓你退縮

110
00:07:23,670 --> 00:07:26,230
Honestly? Me too.
真的嗎？我也是

111
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,530
-Really? -Yeah.
-真的嗎？ -對

112
00:07:28,810 --> 00:07:32,250
I think that something will come up and I'll...
我以為會發生什麼事 然後我會作…

113
00:07:33,010 --> 00:07:34,310
go all Chandler.
錢德會作的事

114
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:37,480
-But nothing has. -I'm so glad.
-但什麼事都沒發生 -我很高興

115
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:40,480
Thank you for staying so calm during this.
謝謝你在這段時間 一直都非常地冷靜

116
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,950
It's made me stay calm.
它讓我非常地冷靜

117
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,290
I could've been worse.
我可能會更差的

118
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,490
I'll be right there.
我馬上回來

119
00:07:55,170 --> 00:07:58,800
Before Saturday, you've reached Monica and Chandler.
如果你在星期六前打電話來 這裡是摩妮卡跟錢德家

120
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:03,880
But if you're calling after Saturday, you've reached Mr. and Mrs. Bing.
但如果你在星期六後打電話來 這裡是賓氏夫婦家

121
00:08:04,410 --> 00:08:07,350
Please leave a message for... the Bings!
請留話給…賓氏夫婦！

122
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,890
Maureen!
嘿，墨琳！

123
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:30,690
-This is my cousin, Maureen. -We're the Bings.
-她是我表妹墨琳 -我們是賓氏夫婦

124
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:36,670
Hi! You guys look so beautiful.
嗨，你們都很漂亮

125
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,610
Mr. and Mrs. Bing!
賓先生跟賓太太

126
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:43,610
Wow, Monica.
摩妮卡

127
00:08:43,890 --> 00:08:47,690
So you know, I had my older-brother talk with Chandler.
你知道的，我以 「大哥的身份」跟錢德談過

128
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,250
What is that?
你說了什麼？

129
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,590
I told him that if he ever hurt you...
我告訴他如果他敢傷害你…

130
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:56,690
I would hunt him down and kick his ass.
天涯海角我都會找到他 痛扁他

131
00:08:59,730 --> 00:09:03,030
What is the matter with everybody? I'm serious.
大家是怎麼了？我是認真的

132
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:05,540
I would kick his ass!
我會痛扁他！

133
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:10,400
Ross, please, my makeup!
羅斯，拜託，我的妝要糊掉了！

134
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:15,040
-Chandler. -Mom.
-錢德 -媽

135
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:17,840
Thanks for wearing... something.
謝謝你記得穿…衣服來

136
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:24,960
This is so exciting! I thought we screwed you up too much for this.
我真的很興奮 我以為我們害得你不敢結婚

137
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:31,120
Just think, soon there will be lots of little Bings.
你想想，很快地 就會出現很多賓氏小孩

138
00:09:35,940 --> 00:09:39,430
I can't believe I'm going back to get spit on again.
我不敢相信我要回去 讓人家噴口水

139
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:43,470
You're lucky, the people who spit on you are famous.
你很幸運 至少噴你口水的人都很有名

140
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:48,180
-Who spits on you? -I don't want to talk about work.
-誰對你噴口水？ -我不想談工作的事

141
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:53,750
Mrs. Bing? These are my parents, Judy and Jack Geller.
賓太太？他們是我爸媽 茱蒂跟傑克蓋勒

142
00:09:53,990 --> 00:09:57,790
-It's lovely to meet you. -Are you his mother or father?
-很高興能見到你 -你是他媽媽還是他爸爸？

143
00:09:58,030 --> 00:09:59,750
Jack!
傑克！

144
00:10:00,700 --> 00:10:03,320
What? I've never seen one before.
什麼？我沒看過變性人

145
00:10:03,530 --> 00:10:05,900
Dad, there's Ross. Go talk to him.
爸，羅斯在那邊 去跟他談一談吧

146
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:09,330
I wasn't even able to act like I'm okay with it.
我甚至沒辦法 假裝我不會在意

147
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,640
Hello, all.
大家好

148
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:17,670
Hi... Dad.
嗨…爸爸

149
00:10:19,650 --> 00:10:21,510
Hi, Mr. Bing.
嗨，賓先生

150
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:26,110
-Nora. -Charles.
-諾拉 -查爾斯

151
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:30,720
-It's so great to see you both here. -Yes.
-很高興你們兩個都來了 -對

152
00:10:30,990 --> 00:10:34,660
Although we may be seeing too much of some people.
雖然有些人是衣不蔽體

153
00:10:37,470 --> 00:10:40,700
Aren't you too old to wear a dress like that?
你不覺得自己太老了 不該穿那種衣服嗎？

154
00:10:40,970 --> 00:10:45,060
Don't you have too much penis to wear a dress like that?
你不覺得自己是個男人 不該穿那種衣服嗎？

155
00:10:46,810 --> 00:10:48,500
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天啊

156
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:53,840
Of course you can kick his ass, son.
你當然可以痛扁他，兒子

157
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:57,570
You could kick anyone's ass you want to.
你想痛扁任何人都沒有問題

158
00:10:58,490 --> 00:11:01,150
Thanks, you guys.
謝謝你們

159
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,890
-Rach, Rach? -Yeah?
-瑞秋？ -什麼？

160
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:10,150
Talk to Chandler's dad and keep him away from Chandler's mom.
快去跟錢德的爸聊天 別讓他跟錢德的媽媽槓上了

161
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:14,700
-What's he look like? -A man in a black dress.
-但我不知道他長什麼樣子 -他穿著黑色洋裝

162
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:25,770
I'm Rachel, a friend of Monica and Chandler's.
嗨，我是瑞秋 摩妮卡跟錢德的朋友

163
00:11:26,010 --> 00:11:29,110
-I'm Amanda. -Oh, I get it.
-我是亞曼達 -喔，我懂了

164
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:32,610
"A man, duh!"
「男人，啊！」

165
00:11:37,290 --> 00:11:39,380
Could I have your attention?
請大家聽我說

166
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:44,730
-I'm Ross Geller. -Dr. Ross Geller.
-我是羅斯蓋勒 -羅斯蓋勒博士

167
00:11:45,770 --> 00:11:49,730
Dad, please. As I was saying...
爸，拜託，我剛剛說過…

168
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:52,630
I'm Dr. Ross Geller.
我是羅斯蓋勒博士

169
00:11:54,210 --> 00:11:56,040
And I'm the best man.
我是伴郎

170
00:11:56,910 --> 00:12:00,780
This marriage is doubly special for me...
這段婚姻對我來說有雙重意義…

171
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:04,920
because not only is the groom my best friend...
不只因為新郎是我的好朋友…

172
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:09,780
but the bride is my little sister.
更因為新娘是我的妹妹

173
00:12:12,030 --> 00:12:15,220
She's the greatest sister a guy could ask for.
她是所有男人 夢寐以求的好妹妹

174
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:19,130
Please join me in raising a glass...
請大家跟我一起舉杯…

175
00:12:19,570 --> 00:12:22,590
to the couple we're here to celebrate.
敬這對新人

176
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:26,240
-To the Bings. -To the Bings!
-敬賓氏夫婦 -敬賓氏夫婦！

177
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:36,640
I'm gonna steam my dress.
我要去熨婚紗了

178
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:39,480
Who will make sure nothing happens to it?
誰負責確定它不會有問題？

179
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:42,480
-I'll do it. -Who wants it? Anybody?
-我會負責 -誰要負責？有人願意嗎？

180
00:12:43,090 --> 00:12:45,420
-I said I'll do it. -Nobody?
-我說我會負責 -沒有人嗎？

181
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:49,690
-All right, I'll do it myself. -I'm not gonna screw it up.
-好吧，那麼我就自己來 -我不會搞砸的

182
00:12:49,930 --> 00:12:53,560
You're right. I'm sorry. You were a big help tonight.
你說的對，對不起 今晚你幫了大忙

183
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:57,360
Thanks for helping my grandmother get to the hotel.
謝謝你幫忙 將我奶奶安全地送回飯店

184
00:12:57,640 --> 00:13:01,800
-Of course! That's what I'm here for. -Okay. Sorry.
-當然，那就是我的工作 -好吧，對不起

185
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:05,200
What grandmother?
什麼奶奶？

186
00:13:09,450 --> 00:13:13,010
-Where have you been? -Taking my parents to the hotel.
-你跑到哪裡去了？ -我送我爸媽回飯店

187
00:13:13,290 --> 00:13:15,350
-Going back to work? -Yeah.
-你要回去工作了？ -對

188
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:19,180
-Nice shades. -If I wear these in my scenes...
-很酷的太陽眼鏡 -我想如果我能戴上它拍戲

190
00:13:19,390 --> 00:13:21,830
I won't get spit in my eyes.
我的眼睛就不會噴到口水了

191
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:27,970
And, if I remember correctly, Ray-Ban was the official sponsor of WWI.
如果我沒有記錯 雷朋是一次大戰的正式贊助商

192
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:31,540
Great! All right!
太棒了！帥啊！

193
00:13:31,970 --> 00:13:33,670
I'll see you later.
-待會見 -好吧

194
00:13:33,910 --> 00:13:37,240
-Where's Chandler? -I think he's in Rachel's room.
-錢德在哪裡？ -我想他在瑞秋的房間裡

195
00:13:38,610 --> 00:13:40,050
Chandler?
錢德？

196
00:14:04,710 --> 00:14:07,900
-Is Monica here? -She's steaming her dress. Why?
-摩妮卡在嗎？ -她在熨婚紗，怎麼了？

197
00:14:09,210 --> 00:14:11,740
-I think Chandler's gone. -What?
-我想錢德走了 -什麼？

198
00:14:12,710 --> 00:14:16,650
-He left that. -"Tell Monica I'm sorry."
-他留下了這個 -「告訴摩妮卡我很抱歉」

199
00:14:17,350 --> 00:14:19,250
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天啊

200
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,910
What's up?
怎麼了？

201
00:14:23,290 --> 00:14:25,720
"Tell Monica I'm sorry."
「告訴摩妮卡我很抱歉」

202
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,060
Tell her yourself.
你自己去告訴她

203
00:14:35,870 --> 00:14:38,900
Oh, my God. Chandler just left, though?
喔，我的天啊，錢德走了？

204
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,730
Maybe it's not what we think.
或許事情不是我們想的那樣 或許他是說：

205
00:14:42,010 --> 00:14:46,040
"Tell Monica I'm sorry I drank the last of the milk."
「告訴摩妮卡我很抱歉 我把牛奶都喝光了」

206
00:14:46,250 --> 00:14:50,840
Or maybe he was writing to tell her that he's changed his name:
或許他寫這張字條告訴她 他改了名字

207
00:14:51,090 --> 00:14:54,180
"Tell Monica, I'm Sorry."
「告訴摩妮卡我叫抱歉」

208
00:14:56,620 --> 00:15:01,690
-It means he freaked out and left! -Don't be so negative!
-這表示他嚇得逃跑了！ -別那麼消極！

209
00:15:02,130 --> 00:15:07,530
Good God, isn't it possible that "Sorry" is sitting in there right now?
天啊，有沒有可能「抱歉」 現在就坐在裡面

210
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:12,630
Phoebe, I think Ross is right. What are we gonna do?
菲比，我想羅斯說的對 我們該怎麼辦？

211
00:15:13,010 --> 00:15:16,500
I'm gonna have to go find him and bring him back.
我得去找他，把他帶回來

212
00:15:16,710 --> 00:15:20,310
You make sure Monica does not find out, okay?
你們別讓摩妮卡 發現這件事，好嗎？

213
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:23,710
But, if you don't find him and bring him back...
如果你沒辦法找到他 把他帶回來…

214
00:15:23,950 --> 00:15:28,290
I am gonna hunt you down and kick your ass!
天涯海角我都會找到你 痛扁你！

215
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,790
I will find him.
我會找到他的

216
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:38,230
Joey? Can you go through these lines with me?
喬伊，你能跟我對一下台詞嗎？

217
00:15:38,470 --> 00:15:41,460
Oh, man, they just re-did my makeup.
喔，天啊，他們才幫我補好妝

218
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:46,070
-Just the last two pages. -All right.
-只要對最後兩頁 -好吧

219
00:15:50,340 --> 00:15:52,110
I found the picture!
我發現照片了！

220
00:15:53,550 --> 00:15:55,240
Picture? What picture?
照片？什麼照片？

221
00:15:55,450 --> 00:15:58,540
The picture of my wife I found in your pack.
我在你的背包裡 發現了我太太的照片

222
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:03,420
-Could you lower the script? -I don't want to.
-你能把劇本放下來嗎？ -我不想

223
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:08,690
I need to see your face so I can play off your reaction.
我得看到你的臉 才能知道你的反應

224
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,960
Okay, look.
好吧，聽我說

225
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:15,790
I know you're great and play all those Shakespeare guys...
我知道你的演技很棒 演過很多莎翁名劇…

226
00:16:16,070 --> 00:16:18,200
but you're spitting all over me, man.
但你噴得我滿臉是口水

227
00:16:18,940 --> 00:16:22,100
-Of course I am! -You know you've been spitting?
-那當然！ -你知道你會噴口水？

228
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:24,610
That's what real actors do.
真正的演員都會那麼做

229
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:29,280
Enunciation is the mark of a good actor.
發音是好演員的註冊商標

230
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:32,710
And when you enunciate, you spit!
發音正確時就會噴口水！

231
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:37,450
Wow. Didn't know that.
我不知道這件事

232
00:16:37,690 --> 00:16:39,630
Thanks. Okay, check it out.
謝了，好吧，看我的

233
00:16:41,530 --> 00:16:44,400
Picture? What picture?
照片？什麼照片？

234
00:16:53,170 --> 00:16:56,900
-Have you seen Chandler? -No, I haven't seen him.
-阿甘，你看到錢德了嗎？ -不，我沒有看到他

235
00:16:57,180 --> 00:17:00,200
-Damn. -He's getting married tomorrow, right?
-該死 -他明天要結婚了，對吧？

236
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:03,180
Yes. Don't worry. Everything's fine.
對，別擔心，一切都會沒事的

237
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:06,710
-See you at the wedding. -I wasn't invited.
-明天婚禮上見 -我沒有被邀請

238
00:17:08,490 --> 00:17:11,720
Then we'll see you the day after tomorrow.
那麼後天見

239
00:17:14,730 --> 00:17:16,200
Mom? Dad?
媽？爸？

240
00:17:17,030 --> 00:17:18,730
What are you doing here?
你在這裡做什麼？

241
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:22,440
We thought we'd see what the fuss is all about.
我們想看看 這裡到底有什麼特別的

242
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:26,370
-I see why the girls like coming here. -Why?
-我知道為什麼女孩們喜歡來這裡 -為什麼？

243
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:29,340
The sexy blond behind the counter.
為了吧檯後面那個性感大帥哥

244
00:17:34,950 --> 00:17:38,910
-Gunther? -She just added him to her list.
-阿甘？ -她剛剛把他列入她的名單

245
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:43,650
-Your list? -Of people we're allowed to sleep..
-什麼？你的名單？ -我們可以上床的對象…

246
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:46,020
I know what the list is.
我知道那是什麼樣的名單

247
00:17:46,590 --> 00:17:49,290
Come on, sit down. Have a cup of joe.
快坐下吧，喝杯咖啡

248
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:53,060
Dad, I can't. I'm sorry.
爸爸，我沒空，抱歉

249
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:56,700
If you see Chandler, tell him I'm looking for him.
如果你看到錢德 告訴他我在找他

250
00:17:56,940 --> 00:18:01,270
And if you see Rita Moreno, let her know I'm looking for her.
如果你看到麗塔莫雷諾 告訴她我在找她

251
00:18:06,710 --> 00:18:08,110
Action!
開始！

252
00:18:11,550 --> 00:18:13,320
I found the picture!
我發現照片了！

253
00:18:13,890 --> 00:18:15,950
What picture?
什麼照片？

254
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:20,120
A picture of my wife, in your pack!
我在你的背包裡發現了我太太的照片

255
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:23,460
You went through my personal property?
你偷翻我的私人物品？

256
00:18:24,830 --> 00:18:28,320
Why do you have a picture of Paulette in your pack?
你的背包裡 為什麼會有寶麗蒂的照片？

257
00:18:31,610 --> 00:18:34,940
Because, Vincent, we were lovers...
文森，因為我們交往過…

258
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:38,070
for two years!
...兩年！

259
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:40,970
Cut! Wonderful!
卡！太棒了！

260
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:45,250
Great scene, huh?
真的是太棒了！

261
00:18:45,490 --> 00:18:49,120
You were awesome. In that last speech, you soaked me.
你真的很棒 最後那一段你噴得我的臉都濕了

262
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:52,780
-Tomorrow's call sheet. -I'm not working tomorrow.
-這是明天的通告表 -明天我不會工作

263
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:56,090
-You are now. -No, you gotta get me out of it.
-現在是了 -不，你得幫我這個忙

264
00:18:56,330 --> 00:18:58,590
I have plans. Important plans!
我已經有約了，這件事非常重要！

265
00:19:06,870 --> 00:19:10,740
-Still no word from Chandler. -Oh, man.
-羅斯說還是沒有錢德的消息 -喔，天啊

266
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:14,350
But they found the grandmother wandering down 5th.
但他們發現 奶奶在第五大道上遊蕩

267
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,880
Okay, well there's one down.
好吧，至少找到一個人了

268
00:19:19,350 --> 00:19:21,250
I'm getting married today!
今天我要結婚了

269
00:19:25,030 --> 00:19:28,760
I cracked a rib, but I don't care. Today's my wedding!
我斷了一根肋骨，但我不在乎 今天我要結婚了！

270
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,490
My day is finally here!
我終於要結婚了！

271
00:19:34,270 --> 00:19:36,860
She might not even notice he's gone.
或許她不會注意到他不見了

272
00:19:38,470 --> 00:19:40,840
I'm gonna start getting ready!
我要開始準備了！

273
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:46,670
We can't let her start getting ready. This is too awful!
我們不能讓她開始準備 這太可怕了！

274
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:50,010
She'll be in the gown, and he won't show up.
但等她換上婚紗 而他又沒有出現時…

275
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:53,150
Then she'll have to take off the gown..
這時候她得脫掉婚紗…

276
00:19:53,350 --> 00:19:56,020
Stop it. You can't do this here.
冷靜點，你不能在這裡抓狂

277
00:19:57,660 --> 00:19:59,150
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
對不起，抱歉

278
00:19:59,390 --> 00:20:01,860
It's just so sad.
那真的是太悲傷了

279
00:20:02,060 --> 00:20:05,090
Pull it together. She can't see you like this.
振作一點 別讓她看到你這個樣子

280
00:20:05,370 --> 00:20:08,530
-She'll know something's wrong. -I know. I know.
-她會發現不對勁的 -我知道，天啊！

281
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:11,030
There's no tissue.
沒有面紙了

282
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:13,740
Can you grab me some toilet paper?
你能拿張衛生紙給我嗎？

283
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:17,900
Oh, that's gone too. This is Monica's bathroom, right?
喔，衛生紙也沒有了 這裡是摩妮卡的浴室吧？

284
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:21,240
I found one.
-我找到一張了 -好吧

285
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:25,840
Thank you.
-拿去吧 -謝謝

286
00:20:26,050 --> 00:20:27,920
Oh, God.
喔，天啊

287
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:32,330
Can I have another one?
能再給我一張嗎？

288
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:34,760
Sure.
沒問題

289
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:39,830
Do you need some floss?
你需要牙線嗎？

290
00:20:41,570 --> 00:20:45,230
I can't imagine what will happen if he doesn't show up.
我無法想像如果他不出現 會發生什麼事

291
00:20:45,470 --> 00:20:46,960
Here's a whole bunch.
這裡有一大堆衛生紙

292
00:20:47,210 --> 00:20:49,400
She'll be at the wedding waiting...
她會在禮堂等他…

293
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:53,140
and people will be whispering, "That poor girl."
大家會竊竊竊竊私語 「喔，那個可憐的女孩」

294
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:56,750
Then she'll have to come back here and live alone.
然後她得回來這裡 獨自一個人過生活

295
00:20:56,950 --> 00:20:58,850
-Oh, my God. -What?
-喔，我的天啊 -什麼？

296
00:20:59,090 --> 00:21:04,490
There was a pregnancy test in the garbage, and it's positive.
垃圾桶有一根驗孕棒 是陽性反應

297
00:21:05,130 --> 00:21:07,220
Monica's pregnant.
摩妮卡懷孕了

298
00:21:09,430 --> 00:21:12,230
So I guess she won't be totally alone.
我猜她不會寂寞了

299
00:21:19,140 --> 00:21:20,160
Next time on Friends:
下集提要

300
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:23,270
-We've gotta tell her. -No, we can't.
-我們得告訴她他失蹤了 -不，我們不能那麼做

301
00:21:23,510 --> 00:21:25,100
She's getting ready.
她很快就會開始做準備

302
00:21:25,310 --> 00:21:27,300
Can't you stall her?
你不能拖延她嗎？

303
00:21:27,510 --> 00:21:30,480
I'm never gonna get married.
我永遠都沒辦法結婚了！

304
00:21:31,180 --> 00:21:36,280
We've just got one scene with you two, and Richard is a pro.
我們只要拍一場戲 就你跟理查，他是職業高手

305
00:21:36,990 --> 00:21:38,960
-Are you drunk? -No!
-你喝醉了嗎？ -沒有

306
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:40,180
Yes, you are!
你喝醉了！

307
00:21:40,590 --> 00:21:42,790
All right.
好吧

308
00:21:43,230 --> 00:21:45,100
-How's Chandler? -Great!
-錢德還好嗎？ -他好極了

309
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:46,820
-Where are you? -On the set.
-你在哪裡？ -我還在片場裡

310
00:21:47,030 --> 00:21:50,090
It's turning into the worst wedding ever.
這將會是有史以來 最糟糕的一場婚禮

311
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


312
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
